OL,3,GNEWSA'He's sparko', said one-punch
OL,4,Akiller after attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA one-punch killer who said his victim
OL,7,Fwas "sparko" after unleashing a violent
OL,8,Fattack outside a row of shops has been
OL,9,Fjailed for manslaughter.
OL,11,FAndrew Allen, 55, assaulted Scott
OL,12,FLisney, 56, at St Olaves Street
OL,13,Fshopping precinct in Bury St Edmunds on
OL,14,F26 July 2025.
OL,16,FLisney was taken to the town's West
OL,17,FSuffolk Hospital and placed in an
OL,18,Finduced coma after suffering a bleed on
OL,19,Fthe brain, but he died two days later.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
