OL,3,GNEWSA'He's sparko', said one-punch
OL,4,Akiller after attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing a six-day trial at
OL,7,FPeterborough Crown Court, a jury
OL,8,Freturned a unanimous guilty verdict and
OL,9,FAllen, of Severn Road in Bury, was
OL,10,Fsentenced to four years in prison.
